Note that when we say the grid is 5 by 5 we mean that each row and column contains 5 dots!

The smaller square in the figure below has a perimeter of $4$ cm, and the larger square has an area of $16$ $\text{cm}^2$.  What is the distance from point $A$ to point $B$? Express your answer as a decimal to the nearest tenth.

[asy]
draw((0,0)--(12,0));
draw((2,0)--(2,10));
draw((0,0)--(0,2));
draw((0,2)--(2,2));
draw((0,2)--(12,10));
draw((12,0)--(12,10));
draw((2,10)--(12,10));
label("B",(0,2),W);
label("A",(12,10),E);
[/asy]
